            "html": "<section id=\"beneficios\" class=\"benefits-section section-copy\" aria-labelledby=\"benefits-heading\">\n      <div class=\"benefits-container\">\n        <header class=\"benefits-header\">\n          <h2 id=\"benefits-heading\" class=\"section-title benefits-title\">\n            ¡NO HAY EXCUSA PARA CONOCER TU NUEVO HOGAR!\n          </h2>\n        </header>\n\n        <ul class=\"benefits-grid\">\n          <li class=\"benefit-item\">\n            <div class=\"benefit-icon-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                <path d=\"M12 21s-6.5-5.8-6.5-11.2a6.5 6.5 0 1 1 13 0C18.5 15.2 12 21 12 21Z\" />\n                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9.8\" r=\"2.3\" />\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3 class=\"benefit-heading\">Te buscamos y te dejamos en casa</h3>\n            <p class=\"benefit-text\">\n              Tú nos dices donde y nosotros te buscamos y te dejamos.\n            </p>\n          </li>\n\n          <li class=\"benefit-item\">\n            <div class=\"benefit-icon-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                <path d=\"M12 20.5s-7-4.5-7-10a4 4 0 0 1 7-2.6A4 4 0 0 1 19 10.5c0 5.5-7 10-7 10Z\" />\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3 class=\"benefit-heading\">Ven con los que más quieres</h3>\n            <p class=\"benefit-text\">\n              Preparamos zona de juegos, cabritas y algo fresco para el calor y además pet friendly.\n            </p>\n          </li>\n\n          <li class=\"benefit-item\">\n            <div class=\"benefit-icon-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                <path d=\"M3 10.5 12 3l9 7.5\" />\n                <path d=\"M5.5 9.5V20h13V9.5\" />\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3 class=\"benefit-heading\">Recorrido 360%</h3>\n            <p class=\"benefit-text\">\n              Por amplios departamentos de 2 dormitorios y 2 baños en La Florida y terminaciones boutique.\n            </p>\n          </li>\n\n          <li class=\"benefit-item\">\n            <div class=\"benefit-icon-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                <path d=\"M6.5 4h11l3.5 5.5L12 20 3 9.5 6.5 4Z\" />\n                <path d=\"M3 9.5h18\" />\n                <path d=\"M12 20L8.5 9.5 10.5 4\" />\n                <path d=\"M12 20l3.5-10.5L13.5 4\" />\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3 class=\"benefit-heading\">Beneficio exclusivo Open House</h3>\n            <p class=\"benefit-text\">\n              Desde 3.699 UF con estacionamiento y bodega incluido, hasta 36 cuotas para el pie y regalos extras.\n            </p>\n          </li>\n\n          <li class=\"benefit-item\">\n            <div class=\"benefit-icon-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n                <path d=\"M4 17l5.5-5.5 4 4L20 9\" />\n                <path d=\"M15 9h5v5\" />\n              </svg>\n            </div>\n            <h3 class=\"benefit-heading\">Para vivir o invertir</h3>\n            <p class=\"benefit-text\">\n              Un hogar para vivir ampliamente con tu familia o una inversión con conectividad y proyección en la Florida.\n            </p>\n          </li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <div class=\"benefits-cta-wrap\">\n          <a href=\"#contacto\" class=\"benefits-cta-btn\">¡Quiero conocer mi próximo hogar!</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n<footer class=\"site-footer section-copy\">\n    <div class=\"footer-container\">\n      <div class=\"footer-info-grid\">\n        <div class=\"footer-col\">\n          <span class=\"footer-col-label\">Proyecto y Respaldo</span>\n          <div class=\"footer-brand-pair\">\n            <img\n              src=\"https://lupdesign.github.io/landing-alto-zanartu/assets/logos/logotipo.svg\"\n              alt=\"Alto Zañartu\"\n              class=\"footer-logo-az\"\n              loading=\"lazy\"\n            />\n            <span class=\"footer-logo-divider\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n            <img\n              src=\"https://lupdesign.github.io/landing-alto-zanartu/media/logo%20vector%20.svg\"\n              alt=\"Constructora Vector\"\n              class=\"footer-logo-vector\"\n              loading=\"lazy\"\n            />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"footer-col\">\n          <span class=\"footer-col-label\">Comercializa</span>\n          <img\n            src=\"https://lupdesign.github.io/landing-alto-zanartu/media/logo%20onekey.svg\"\n            alt=\"OneKey\"\n            class=\"footer-logo-onekey\"\n            loading=\"lazy\"\n          />\n        </div>\n\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"footer-back-top\">Volver arriba</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"footer-bottom-bar\">\n        <span>© 2026 Constructora Vector. Todos los derechos reservados</span>\n        <span>Corregidor Zañartu 11544, La Florida</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>"
